{{ToonInfo|Toon=Teagan|extra=Teacup|Date=July 12, 2024|with={{CI|Flutter|name=true}}, {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}, and {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}|Pronoun=She}}

==Appearance==
Teagan is a white teacup with a light yellow base, scalloped edge, and body. She has golden eyeshadow and droopy, black eyes with two eyelashes on the bottom. She wears a long, V-necked dress the same shade as her eyeshadow with three tiny, light gold stars in the top right, bottom right, bottom left, and back of the dress. She wears two golden gloves and holds a fluffy white boa shawl around her neck. She has sweet tea inside of her head (confirmed in her dialogue with {{CI|Finn|name=true}}) and also a black bottom lipstick. A wistful expression is on her face in her 3D model. In her Introduction Card Artwork, she appears to have a closed-mouth smile.

==Personality==
Teagan is a kind, polite, and elegant [[Toon]] who likes to invite the other Toons to their tea gatherings. She knows how to make the teas suitable for the other Toons, and has memorized their favorite kinds of tea, which is stated in their introduction card and proven by their interactions. She is also calm and composed, and she seems to like to keep etiquette, based on their interaction with {{CI|Rodger|name=true}}, where she said she makes sure no [[Ichor]] gets on her boa.

She is shown to be very accommodating and understanding of Toons' needs. She offers {{CI|Goob|name=true}} straws due to his wobbly arms causing him to drop cups, and suggest a different kind of party that can accommodate to {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}'s hyperactivity. She also offers to serve {{CI|Finn|name=true}} water instead of tea, due to it being the only drink he consumes.

She schedules tea party sessions with individual Toons like {{CI|Brusha|name=true}} to discuss any problems or issues, or simply to help them relax. This plays into a more parental-like side of her, looking after the other Toons and guiding them to certain solutions or paths.

