==Trivia==
*Teagan's name is most likely a nod to her being a teacup and having tea parties.
**The name is also gender-neutral, fitting their pronouns.
**Their name could also possibly be a play-on-words for "Tea" the name "Reagan", which can be considered a gender-neutral name.
*Teagan is the second [[Toon]] to have more than one set of pronouns, with the first being {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}, and the third being {{CI|Looey|name=true}}.
**She is the only female Toon to have such.
*Teagan's interaction with {{CI|Finn|name=true}} confirms the tea in her head is sweet tea.
**Since Finn only likes to drink water, the liquid in his head, it could be implied that Teagan prefers sweet tea, though in her case the preference most likely is not exclusive.
*Since Teagan spills some tea when using her {{AI|Teagan|name=true}} [[Ability]], it can be inferred that her cup's contents are not vital to their survival.
*Teagan is the first [[Toon]] to use {{Tape|name=true}} for their Active [[Ability]], with the second being {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}, the third being {{CI|Blot|name=true}}, and the fourth being {{CI|Ginger|name=true}} (since the [[2025 Christmas Event]]).
**Before [[Changelog|v0.10.1]], Teagan's '''Tea Time''' Ability costed as much as Sprout and Ginger's, until it was reduced from 100 to 75 Tapes.
*Teagan is currently the only [[Toon]] who has the [[Ability]] to directly heal themself.
**You could count {{CI|Gigi|name=true}} using her {{AI|Gigi}}'''Surprise!''' Ability and getting a {{II|Bandage|name=true}} or a {{II|Health Kit|name=false}}, even though it is not guaranteed, and the items themselves are actually what heal.
*Teagan and [[Finn]] have a few similarities:
**Both released in an update as a "surprise [[Toon]]" with no prior promotion.
***Coincidentally, they also showed up in a thumbnail for the August 14th update.
**Both are the only Toons with liquids in their heads and use a large cork when sleeping.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1300070907372634152</ref>
**Both of their [[Twisted]] counterparts are {{Type|Uncommon}}.
*Teagan is the only [[Toon]] (and character overall) who uses lipstick in their default model, as {{Skin|Spring Outing|toon=[[Cocoa]]}} and {{Skin|Spring-Time|toon=[[Bassie]]}} also do.
*Teagan and {{CI|Flutter|name=true}} are the first [[Toons]] to have an eyeshadow by default, with the second being [[Gigi]], the third being [[Ginger]], the fourth being {{CI|Dyle|name=true}}, and the fifth being {{CI|Ribecca|name=true}}.
*{{CI|Rodger|name=true}} and Teagan both say "{{Text|Simply marvelous!}}" when finishing a [[Machine]].
*Teagan's neck is light yellow in her model, despite it being white in her [[Introduction Card]] and voting icon.
*Just as her Introduction Card shows, Teagan knows all the [[Toons]]' favorite tea.
**{{CI|Boxten|name=true}} seems to prefer herbal tea, their interaction implies that it helps Boxten calm down.
**{{CI|Poppy|name=true}}'s favorite tea is bubble tea, reflective on how Poppy is a bubble herself.
**{{CI|Astro|name=true}} likes iced tea, as implied with their interaction.
**[[Finn]] only drinks water and thus wouldn't have a favorite tea, likely instead being served such by Teagan.
**{{CI|Vee|name=true}} can't consume beverages or food, so she wouldn't have a favorite tea.
**It is likely Teagan's favorite tea is sweet tea, as her head is filled with it.
*Teagan, {{CI|Coal|name=true}}, [[Rodger]], [[Blot]], and {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}} have one of the shortest interactions in the game, having three lines of dialogue.
*In an interaction between them and [[Rodger]], Teagan is said to be good at dodging, probably explaining her higher [[Stamina]]. Their lower [[Stealth]] may also be referenced, as the designs or shapes of teacups tend to be eye catching and decorative.
*As stated in [[Dandy]]'s [[Gossip]], Teagan has a list of [[Toons]] blacklisted from her tea parties. The Toons that are known to be on this list are {{CI|Connie|name=true}}, due to possessing a teapot and getting hot tea on {{CI|Razzle & Dazzle}}[[Dazzle]], and Dandy himself for an unknown reason.
*When Teagan got her optimization in [[Changelog|v0.13.14]], there was a bug where her head had collision with other [[Toons]] in the [[Lobby]] and was quickly patched.
*Teagan was one of the three unoptimized [[Toons]] before [[Changelog|v0.13.14]] to not be featured in any posters, the others being [[Finn]] and [[Gigi]].
*In Teagan's interaction with {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}, when she says "{{Text|How have your tea party sessions with ''her'' been?}}", the "{{Text|her}}" is most likely {{CI|Brusha|name=true}}, due to the fact that Brusha has some issues and Tisha, despite having some rivalries, still slightly cares for her.
*Teagan's {{Skin|Steeped Shadow}} [[Skin]] turns her boa into a vermiform creature with a striking resemblance to sandworms from Beetlejuice.

